sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CM as cert-manager (internal-ca)
    participant AP as approver-policy
    participant C as Client (ns orders)
    participant K as Kafka broker
    participant UO as User Operator

    C->>CM: Certificate CN orders-events.orders.svc, client auth
    CM->>AP: CertificateRequest
    AP-->>CM: approved, a name from its own namespace
    CM-->>C: Secret kafka-client (the key never leaves the namespace)
    UO->>K: ACLs and quotas of KafkaUser orders-events.orders.svc
    C->>K: TLS to 9093, presents its certificate
    Note over K: validates the chain against internal-ca (clients CA, no key)
    Note over K: principal = CN, ACLs only on orders-*
    K-->>C: produces and consumes on orders-*
    Note over C,K: a valid certificate from another namespace authenticates but has no ACLs, denied
